---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <header class="mb-12 text-center" transition:animate="fade">
            <h1 class="text-5xl mb-4">About</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">Mission Statement</p>
        </header>

        <div
            class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none"
            transition:animate="fade"
        >
            <p>
                Hydle Research Group (HRG) is an independent multidisciplinary
                engineering and applied research group exploring technologies
                across engineering, computer science, physics, and related
                scientific disciplines. Our projects showcase analysis and
                process refinement to the creation of advanced systems, whether
                physical or digital.
            </p>
            Being an established educate, or having a PhD isn't explicitly required
            to do research in many fields. It turns out you need commitment and dedication,
            and HRG proves that. While we don't necessarily aim to be the next "Bell
            Labs", we swing for the fences where we can. Our projects build one after
            the next, each one growing off the previous.
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
